\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1  yet, an artist tries all the same, oblivious to what it is that they\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92re actually doing.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 And what is it they are doing?}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Seduction.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Artists are seduced by the delusion that there are \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8216\'91things\u8217\'92 in this world, and they can be understood as whole objects, as distinct things. }
